\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lamb of God, whose dying love
\par We now recall to mind,
\par Send the answer from above,
\par And let us mercy find;
\par Think on us, who think on Thee;
\par And every struggling soul release;
\par O remember Calvary,
\par And bid us go in peace!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. By Thine agonizing pain
\par And sweat of blood, we pray,
\par By Thy dying love to man,
\par Take all our sins away:
\par Burst our bonds, and set us free;
\par From all iniquity release;
\par O remember Calvary,
\par And bid us go in peace!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Let Thy blood, by faith applied,
\par The sinner's pardon seal;
\par Speak us freely justified,
\par And all our sickness heal;
\par By Thy passion on the tree,
\par Let all our griefs and troubles cease;
\par O remember Calvary,
\par And bid us go in peace!
\par                            Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
